<title>USA: Legato names Stephen Wise CFO.</title>
<headline>Legato names Stephen Wise CFO.</headline>
<dateline>PALO ALTO 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Legato Systems Inc said it named Stephen Wise chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Wise was previously senior vice president of finance at Novell Inc.</p>
<p>Legato officials were not immediately available to say who Wise was replacing as CFO.</p>
